            "text": "1 Cor. 15:53 (42–54)."
          },
          {
            "start": 178,
            "end": 183,
            "text": "1 Cor. 15:20 (20–23)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 40:2",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, he bringeth to pass the resurrection of the dead. But behold, my son, the resurrection is not yet. Now, I unfold unto you a mystery; nevertheless, there are many mysteries which are kept, that no one knoweth them save God himself. But I show unto you one thing which I have inquired diligently of God that I might know—that is concerning the resurrection.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 44,
            "text": "TG Resurrection."
          },
          {
            "start": 170,
            "end": 179,
            "text": "TG Mysteries of Godliness."
          },
          {
            "start": 190,
            "end": 194,
            "text": "D&C 25:4; 121:26; 124:41."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
